<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson signs Danish contract with Telia.</title>
<headline>Ericsson signs Danish contract with Telia.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecommunications company LM Ericsson AB said on Tuesday it had signed a contract with Telia Mobile AB to deliver its DCS-1800 system to Telia's Danish mobile telphone network.</p>
<p>Ericsson said in a statement that the first stage of the contract would be worth about 380 million crowns but it could become a billion crown deal.</p>
</text>
